Package: tempcomp-filter-@HOST@
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Christopher Hoover <ch@murgatroid.com>
Depends: tempcomp-filter (>= @VERSION@)
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/charlieh0tel/chrony-tempcomp
Description: tempcomp-filter's settings and chrony's tempcomp line for @HOST@
 The filter's sensor and time constant, in /etc/tempcomp-filter.d, and
 chronyd's tempcomp line on the filter's output, in
 /etc/chrony/conf.d/tempcomp-filter.conf.  chronyd takes the line when
 restarted.
